WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.550
- So originally you were like
an athlete from Hong Kong?

00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:03.390
- Yes, yes, yes.

00:00:03.390 --> 00:00:04.290
- [Kelly] Like fencing, is that?

00:00:04.290 --> 00:00:05.670
- Yeah, I was a fencer.

00:00:05.670 --> 00:00:06.503
- Cool.

00:00:06.503 --> 00:00:07.500
- That's cool.

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:10.170
- My parents, they were Olympians too.

00:00:10.170 --> 00:00:11.003
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:11.003 --> 00:00:12.420
- My dad was a fencer.

00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:13.807
My mom's a gymnast.

00:00:13.807 --> 00:00:15.030
- Wow.

00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:16.140
So I guess it would've been a letdown

00:00:16.140 --> 00:00:17.850
if you didn't do something
in that category.

00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:19.020
- Yes.

00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:23.880
I mean, I was prepping for
London Olympics back then,

00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:25.410
and then I just, while prepping

00:00:25.410 --> 00:00:26.910
I just told my parents,
"Hey, you know what?

00:00:26.910 --> 00:00:29.310
I always had this dream about music.

00:00:29.310 --> 00:00:30.659
Let me do my thing."

00:00:30.659 --> 00:00:32.674
- How did that go over?

00:00:32.674 --> 00:00:35.550
- I mean, they want me, of course,

00:00:35.550 --> 00:00:37.830
to go to the Olympics,
you know, do my thing.

00:00:37.830 --> 00:00:40.830
And you know, it took me
seven months to persuade them.

00:00:40.830 --> 00:00:42.180
- Wow, but you were persistent.

00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:43.013
That's a lot of months.

00:00:43.013 --> 00:00:44.790
- Yeah, they were really against me.

00:00:44.790 --> 00:00:46.650
And then they're like,
"You're outta your mind."

00:00:46.650 --> 00:00:49.860
My principal told me that
this is the worst decision

00:00:49.860 --> 00:00:51.601
you're gonna ever make in your life.

00:00:51.601 --> 00:00:52.920
- [Kelly] Have you sent him a letter?

00:00:52.920 --> 00:00:54.030
- No.

00:00:54.030 --> 00:00:56.013
- I think he knows by now he was wrong.

00:00:56.013 --> 00:00:57.157
- Or like a signed headshot.

00:00:57.157 --> 00:00:58.020
Oh my God.

00:00:58.020 --> 00:01:00.720
- Then after I debut as a singer

00:01:00.720 --> 00:01:04.080
and I went back to have a
concert and I invited him.

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:06.783
And then he said, "Jackson,
we believed in you."

00:01:06.783 --> 00:01:08.370
(everyone laughing)

00:01:08.370 --> 00:01:09.210
We believed.

00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:10.910
- This happens.

00:01:10.910 --> 00:01:12.150
It happens.

00:01:12.150 --> 00:01:12.983
That happened to me.

00:01:12.983 --> 00:01:15.002
I was like, what?

00:01:15.002 --> 00:01:17.137
I was like, people were totally like,

00:01:17.137 --> 00:01:18.180
"That's never gonna happen.

00:01:18.180 --> 00:01:19.110
Everybody has a dream."

00:01:19.110 --> 00:01:21.330
Like, and then they were
like "The whole time,"

00:01:21.330 --> 00:01:22.260
you'd see them on the news.

00:01:22.260 --> 00:01:24.210
And they're like, "We
believed from the beginning."

00:01:24.210 --> 00:01:25.253
And I'm like, you are a liar.

00:01:25.253 --> 00:01:26.350
- We knew you were the one.

00:01:26.350 --> 00:01:28.590
- Yeah, yeah.

00:01:28.590 --> 00:01:30.750
So wait, so were your parents
worried about you guys

00:01:30.750 --> 00:01:31.740
like in the entertainment industry?

00:01:31.740 --> 00:01:32.700
Were they worried?

00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:33.720
- Yeah, at first.

00:01:33.720 --> 00:01:37.560
I said, "Hey, I passed
this audition in Korea.

00:01:37.560 --> 00:01:39.180
I'm going, I'm leaving."

00:01:39.180 --> 00:01:40.770
And then they're like, you know what?

00:01:40.770 --> 00:01:42.660
They told me about this
like entertainment,

00:01:42.660 --> 00:01:43.710
no, they're gonna kidnap you

00:01:43.710 --> 00:01:44.658
and put you in a cave.

00:01:44.658 --> 00:01:46.031
- Oh wait.

00:01:46.031 --> 00:01:47.550
- Yeah, like parents.

00:01:47.550 --> 00:01:48.383
- Yeah.

00:01:48.383 --> 00:01:50.640
- And then they're like,
"No, you not gonna do that.

00:01:50.640 --> 00:01:52.770
They're gonna, I'm not, we're
not gonna see you again.

00:01:52.770 --> 00:01:55.290
You're gonna be MIA."

00:01:55.290 --> 00:01:58.980
And I'm like, no, let me live my dream.

00:01:58.980 --> 00:02:01.516
And yeah, seven months of persuading them

00:02:01.516 --> 00:02:02.970
and they're supportive.

00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:04.200
- That's amazing.

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:05.799
- Do we have to sit this far?

00:02:05.799 --> 00:02:06.926
(woman laughing)

00:02:06.926 --> 00:02:09.291
- You're just so cool
we're giving you room.

00:02:09.291 --> 00:02:10.358
- We wanna adopt him.

00:02:10.358 --> 00:02:12.637
(audience applauding)

00:02:12.637 --> 00:02:14.760
- [Kelly] We were giving you room.

00:02:14.760 --> 00:02:17.490
- Nobody's gonna kidnap you, son.

00:02:17.490 --> 00:02:18.870
There's no caves for you.

00:02:18.870 --> 00:02:20.129
You made it, kid.

00:02:20.129 --> 00:02:21.081
You made it, kid.

